Package: msArrow
Title: Wrapper for Arrow Functions to Handle Large (Proteomics) Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Nico", "Hüttmann", , "huttmann.nico@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-9321-2675"))
Description: Convenient wrappers around some 'arrow' functions for handling 
    large mass spectrometry data, plus an opinionated way to organise datasets. 
    Data are kept on disk as parquet or delimited files and referenced by path 
    rather than held in memory.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
